TITLE=Yomonsni - About - Definitions
BGIMAGE=yo-IMG_20216-5DSR-raw16-rawtherapee-natural.jpg
SUBHEAD=Some definitions






<div class="col-12 col-md-10">


	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Why a glossary?</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">There are a number of words that are created within Yomonsni. When doing something new and different, old words don't always capture the desired nuances, and quite often can contain unwanted implications. To enable a more precise level of communication, new words are needed. Luckily this is pretty easy to do, and here are some of them, along with some other esoteric words that are used within these pages that might not be contained in your personal lexicon. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>

	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw"><a name="yom"></a>Yom</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Yom is a word crafted for Yomonsni. It represents your base physicality, your body. For our purposes, this is the way you manifest to the world, it is your conduit to experiencing life and the universe.  </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>


	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw"><a name="mon"></a>Mon</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Mon is a word crafted for Yomonsni. It represents your mind, which while it has a physical locus, is also a step of abstraction away from the pure physical. For our purposes, this is the seat of your knowledge, your experience, your analytical and critical thinking, it is the locus of the perceptions that flow from your Yom. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>


	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw"><a name="sni"></a>Sni</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Sni is a word crafted for Yomonsni. It reprensents your center, your sense of identity, with no direct ties to your physicality. For our purposes, this is the center of your emotional, expressive, connective and creative identity. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>



  
	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw"><a name="grok"></a>grok</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">A word conjured up by a science fiction author, it is a state of complete understanding of a concept or object, to attain fullness. It may be applied to a living being, but the greater the complexity a thing or being has, the less likely one is to be able to attain a fullness of understanding.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>


	<div class="row">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw"><a name="jassia"></a>Jassia</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Jassia is a Yomonsni term for someone new to the journey of discovery and growth. This is anyone who has chosen to enter the Yomonsni process and to grow within it. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div inner-row>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	

	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw"><a name="siazul"></a>Siazul</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Siazul is a Yomonsni term for someone who delivers all layers of Yomonsni massage, and is able to use the process to facilitate the development of any Jassia. They serve as a catalyst and facilitator for the development that the Jassia wants to undertake.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
